    "fabricationNotes": [
      "Connect an isolated, current-limited 12 V RMS, 50 Hz AC source across J1. Neither input terminal connects to RECT_NEG.",
      "Install C1 positive at RECT_POS and negative at RECT_NEG. Verify BR1 package marks and C1 polarity before applying power.",
      "Measure across RLOAD with an isolated differential probe or battery-powered meter. Disconnect the input and verify the reservoir is discharged before touching the circuit.",
      "The modeled recharge is ideal and omits current limiting, source impedance, inrush, capacitor ESR and tolerances."
    ]
