    "physicalNotes": [
      "Use an isolated low-voltage AC source across A3 and A6. Keep both AC leads isolated from the rectifier output return.",
      "Use insulated Belden 8530 pigtails from the bridge package to A11 (POS), A13 (AC1), A15 (AC2) and A17 (NEG). Verify the marks on the package.",
      "Place RLOAD across F21/F25. Install A3–A13, A6–A15, A11–F21 and A17–F25 jumpers.",
      "Use insulated pigtails from C1 positive to A23 and negative to A26. Jumper A11–A23 and A17–A26.",
      "Use a current-limited isolated source. Verify polarity before energizing and verify discharge before touching C1."
    ],
